  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "description": "The onboarding email campaign: starts, step outcomes, exits, Brevo delivery events and the App Store one-time offer code pool. S3 adds the results table and the experiment readout.",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "env",
        "label": "env",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "warp-mimir"
        },
        "query": "label_values(urnetwork_build_info, env)",
        "definition": "label_values(urnetwork_build_info, env)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "what this is",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "how the campaign works",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Onboarding campaign** (mmm/onboarding/PLAN.md). Server-driven emails E1\u2013E5 through Brevo, one scheduled task per network and step, re-evaluated at send time. `starts` = networks entering (email true/false, sequence variant); `emails` = step outcomes (sent / skipped = condition not met / dry_run = `onboarding.enabled` false / failed = Brevo error, retried); `exits` = why a network left; `webhook events` = Brevo delivery events attributed to a campaign send. The nightly results rollup (02:00 UTC, `OnboardingResultsRollup`) writes the retention and trial-outcome events, recomputes `onboarding_results_daily` for the last `results.rollup_days` cohort days, checks the registry guardrails (a breach pauses the variant: `variants paused`) and prunes old events; `outcome events` = server-written trial.converted / trial.cancelled / refund / retention.* by store (`server` = the rollup, `unknown` = the backstop); `admin results requests` = GET /admin/onboarding/results|experiments by auth result. The per-cohort funnel itself is read from `onboarding_results_daily` through the admin endpoint (mmm/onboarding/analyze.mjs), not from Prometheus. Every `urnetwork_onboarding_*` metric is on this page."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
